 irraa kuteera» jettuu ti.","poem":2}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"Worri Xiyoon jibbu martinuu qaanowanee,","poem":1},{"text":"gara duubaa deebi'uu ti.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"Akka marra mana irratti latee,","poem":1},{"text":"adoo hin guddatin qooruu te'anuu ti;","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"marri sun qabaa harka nama isa haamuu,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"yookiin hanqafoo isaa hin guutu.","poem":2}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"Worri achiin dabaru,","poem":1},{"text":"«Eebbi Mootiin Waan Maraa isiniif te'uu ti!","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"Nuuti maqaa Mootii Waan Maraatiin","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"isin eebbinna!» isaaniin hin jedhin.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/gax_twf/PSA/129.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/gax_twf/PSA/130.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/gax_twf/PSA/128.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":8}